WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.900
Le vidiyo ichaza ukubukeka kwe-fundal red reflex okuvamile nokungajwayelekile.

2
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Ukuhlolwa kwe-reflex ebomvu evamile ye-fundal yilapho ungekho umehluko ophelele ekugqameni nasembalani phakathi kwamehlo amabili anokukhanya kwekhoneal emaphakathi.

3
00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:31.530
Ngisho nokubukeka okuvamile kwe-fundal reflex, noma kunjalo, kuzohluka kuye ngokuthi ukude kangakanani nokuthi ingane ibheke kuphi.

4
00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:42.010
Ukuhlola okusebenzayo lapho kufanele uye ngapha nangapha futhi uye emuva naphambili ngaphakathi naseduze ubude bengalo ukusuka esigulini.

5
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:51.350
Izingane kanye nezingane nazo zizonyakazisa izandla namehlo, okwenza i-reflex ishintshe indlela ebukeka ngayo ngesikhathi sokuhlolwa.

6
00:00:51.910 --> 00:01:02.350
Enganeni emnyama, i-reflex ngokuvamile ibukeka iphaphathekile, inombala ophuzi nomhlophe futhi ngezinye izikhathi noluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka njengombala oyinhloko.

7
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:14.970
Okubalulekile, ekuhloleni okuvamile, akufanele kube nomehluko ophelele ekukhanyeni nasembalani phakathi kwamehlo amabili anokubonisa okuphakathi kwekhone.

8
00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:23.850
I-reflex engavamile yilapho kunomehluko oqhubekayo, wangempela ekukhanyeni nasembalani phakathi kwamehlo amabili.

9
00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:35.840
Ukuboniswa kwekhoneal okususiwe, isigaxa esimnyama esikhona ngaphakathi kwe-reflex yeso elilodwa noma womabili amehlo, noma i-reflex ebomvu engekho ngokuphelele.

10
00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:56.330
Ukuhlolwa kwe-reflex okungavamile kungabonisa ukuba khona kwe-cataract, i-retinoblastoma, isibazi se-corneal, i-squint, iphutha le-refractive noma izinkinga zokuzalwa ezifana ne-coloboma.

11
00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:01.690
Konke lokhu kudinga ukuhlolwa okwengeziwe ngochwepheshe.

12
00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:10.900
Bheka lokhu kucabanga bese uzibuza: ingabe lokhu kujwayelekile noma akujwayelekile? Izimpendulo zizolandela kamuva.

13
00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:45.840
Manje kufanele ube nokuqonda kangcono ukuthi i-reflex evamile ibukeka kanjani, kanye nokukhalipha okungavamile, futhi ukwazi ukuphakamisa imbangela okungenzeka kakhulu.
